=== Consuming ===
If the [[Booster Cookie|Cookie Buff]] and [[God Potion]] are both active, '''Mixins''' can also be consumed directly by right clicking them. This will provide {{Green|3x}} their normal duration (since a Mixin can be applied to up to {{Green|3}} [[God Potion]]s). The timer is separate from the {{Item|God Potion}} timer and is paused if a God Potion is no longer active. The player cannot consume '''Mixins''' they do not meet the requirements for.

== Trivia ==
*Even if the player does not meet the requirements, they can still combine a '''Mixin''' with a {{Item|God Potion}} in a {{Item|Brewing Stand}}.
**However, they still will be unable to consume the God Potion.
*Any number of '''Mixins''' can be applied to the same God Potion. Their order in the tooltip is the same order in which they were applied. Example of a maxed [[God Potion]]:{{Slot|God Potion|title=&cGod Potion|text=&7Consume this potion to receive an/&7assortment of positive &dpotion effects&7!/&5&o/&7Duration: &a12h//&7The duration of God Potions can be stacked!//&7Mixins:/&9  Zombie Brain/&9  Gabagoey/&9  Spider Egg/&9  Wolf Fur/&9  End Portal Fumes/&9  Deepterror/&9  Hot Chocolate/&9  Glowing Mush/&9  Pigs Brain/&9  Celestial Mason Jar/&9  Blended Fish/&9  Hotspot Tonic/&9  Melon Juice/&9  Blizzard Bottle/&9  Scatha In A Bottle/&5&o/&eRight-click to consume!/&5&o/&c&lSPECIAL}}
*Despite the '''Mixin'''{{'}}s name being [[Pig Brain Mixin]] the effect shows as "Pigs Brain" on the God Potion tooltip.
*All '''Mixins''' have a hidden cooldown of {{Green|0.5s}}.

